### 🚀 Step-by-Step GitHub Upload Instructions

<Sequence>
  <Step title="Create Repository on GitHub">
    Go to [GitHub New Repository](https://github.com/new), set repository name to `portfolio` or `signal-observatory`, select **Public**, and click **Create repository**.
  </Step>
  <Step title="Add Files">
    Click **Uploading an existing file** on the new repo page. Drag and drop both `index.html` and `README.md`.
  </Step>
  <Step title="Commit Changes">
    Click **Commit changes**. Your code is now fully uploaded!
  </Step>
</Sequence>

